### 优化完整版
  I am writing to apply for the activity of teaching kids in remote rural areas.
  For one thing, children in remote rural areas are short of rich learning resources, and they are in great need of help. I have been fully prepared for this volunteer work.
For another, I hope to develop my sense of responsibility through this meaningful activity.
  Besides, I am qualified for this activity. I major in education. I once took part in a teaching competition and won an award. I am able to give lessons to children and assist 
them with their schoolwork patiently.
  I would appreciate it if you could consider my application. Looking forward to your reply.
